          "settings": {
            "text": "No offsets, no certifications we did not earn.",
            "size": "h2",
            "column": "first"
          }
        },
        "b_2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We do not buy carbon credits, and we do not print a badge we cannot explain. What we can account for is the fibre, the hands, the repair and the thirty years. The Top System took the 2025 Green Product Award in Berlin on that basis — plant-based materials, Orange Fiber, and seasonal construction.</p>",
